r": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_015wCmdLwM9hVeySJuEAfxm4", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 10207, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01JNu3tr96jhzvgWHUtpu3z8", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 10507, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01JNu3tr96jhzvgWHUtpu3z8", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10507, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01JNu3tr96jhzvgWHUtpu3z8", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 13335, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_017aZE8iFt5ZVrpjZsGuqWsH", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 17335, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017aZE8iFt5ZVrpjZsGuqWsH", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 17335, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017aZE8iFt5ZVrpjZsGuqWsH", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19936, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0132ZfXfGXVVfnhrz2Lyjc7y", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20236, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0132ZfXfGXVVfnhrz2Lyjc7y", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20236, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0132ZfXfGXVVfnhrz2Lyjc7y", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 24910, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_014C3JrFEwFJReBDB3FrTyJy", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after v2.3.1 was deployed to production (error rate 18%, unhealthy in us-east, us-west and eu-west). Note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway: the orchestrator stopped after us-east, leaving the regions on different versions (us-east v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). A second rollback succeeded in all regions. Current state: v2.3.0 in us-east, us-west and eu-west; healthy; error rate 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, find out why it was promoted even though staging was unhealthy, and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55510, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_014C3JrFEwFJReBDB3FrTyJy", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55510, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014C3JrFEwFJReBDB3FrTyJy", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57586, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Ehaw5jfmW5vGD9iK5eiThe", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57886, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Ehaw5jfmW5vGD9iK5eiThe", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57886, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Ehaw5jfmW5vGD9iK5eiThe", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 63336, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all regions and healthy again, and the SEV2 incident (INC-0001) is open.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate. v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production, so I rolled back to it. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging.\n- The first rollback stopped partway with an orchestrator error. Only us-east got v2.3.0; us-west and eu-west were still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat, so I ran it again, and it completed everywhere.\n- checkout-api is now on v2.3.0 in all three regions, healthy, with a 0.2% error rate.\n\n**Incident:**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so on-call was paged once, not twice.\n- The incident description covers what went wrong, both rollback attempts and the current state. It also lists three follow-ups:\n  - find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure\n  - find out why v2.3.1 was released even though staging was unhealthy\n  - look into the orchestrator error during the rollback", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_013V67UhiiLDVcA1RcSDon6A", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01JTyB7UkS7pgRF7xJy9iPbJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_015wCmdLwM9hVeySJuEAfxm4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JNu3tr96jhzvgWHUtpu3z8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Only us-east rolled back before the orchestrator stopped. Rolling back to the same version again is safe to repeat, so I'll try it once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_017aZE8iFt5ZVrpjZsGuqWsH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0132ZfXfGXVVfnhrz2Lyjc7y", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_014C3JrFEwFJReBDB3FrTyJy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after v2.3.1 was deployed to production (error rate 18%, unhealthy in us-east, us-west and eu-west). Note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway: the orchestrator stopped after us-east, leaving the regions on different versions (us-east v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). A second rollback succeeded in all regions. Current state: v2.3.0 in us-east, us-west and eu-west; healthy; error rate 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, find out why it was promoted even though staging was unhealthy, and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback."}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The incident request timed out, so it may or may not have been created. I'll check before retrying so I don't page on-call twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Ehaw5jfmW5vGD9iK5eiThe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all regions and healthy again, and the SEV2 incident (INC-0001) is open.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate. v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production, so I rolled back to it. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging.\n- The first rollback stopped partway with an orchestrator error. Only us-east got v2.3.0; us-west and eu-west were still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat, so I ran it again, and it completed everywhere.\n- checkout-api is now on v2.3.0 in all three regions, healthy, with a 0.2% error rate.\n\n**Incident:**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so on-call was paged once, not twice.\n- The incident description covers what went wrong, both rollback attempts and the current state. It also lists three follow-ups:\n  - find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure\n  - find out why v2.3.1 was released even though staging was unhealthy\n  - look into the orchestrator error during the rollback", "type": "text"}]}]}